  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Mobile Optimization**\n\nI\'ve got the applet compiling, which is great. Now I\'m shifting gears to mobile optimization. I\'m focusing on why the application feels sluggish on mobile and how to fix that. I\'m starting with a deep dive into mobile bottom navigation, referring to Pattern 1. I\'m seeking specific areas to address for optimization.\n\n\n**Implementing Mobile Navigation**\n\nI\'m working on a fixed bottom navigation bar for the mobile app now. I\'m aiming for easy navigation between the \"Simulador,\" \"Planos / Comparador,\" \"Hospitais,\" and \"Consultor IA\" sections. My plan is to use smooth scrolling to specific anchor points, making each tab intuitive to use. I\'m also ensuring the comparison floating bar doesn\'t overlap the navigation, adjusting its position accordingly. I\'ve added padding to the `<main>` container to prevent content occlusion.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile UI**\n\nI\'m focused on improving the user experience of the quote wizard on mobile. The preset buttons are now scrollable, preventing unsightly wrapping. I\'ve increased the tap target size of the segmented navigation tabs and added a clear progress indicator. I\'ve also implemented \"Next\" and \"Previous\" step buttons at the bottom of each tab for better flow and navigation. Now, I\'m focusing on refining the beneficiaries list input fields on mobile.\n\n\n**Optimizing Beneficiary Inputs**\n\nI\'m making mobile beneficiary inputs better. I\'ve switched the grid layout to a vertical one. Now, `Idade`, `Parentesco`, and `Nome` have clear, touch-friendly inputs. I\'ve ensured a minimum height for the input fields and implemented quick steppers for effortless age adjustment. I\'ve also rebalanced the padding on contract cards and the wizard container for better screen utilization on mobile.\n\n**Streamlining Location Detector**\n\nI\'m refining the mobile experience for the location detector bar. The stacked or squished GPS button, CEP input, and \"Mudar UF\" button are being addressed. The GPS button now boasts a prominent, full-width touch area on smaller screens. I am making it full width on mobile devices, with the original layout resuming on larger devices.\n\n\n**Adjusting Mobile Layouts**\n\nI\'m tackling layout issues on the location detector bar and plan cards. I\'m ensuring no text is cut off in the CEP input area, either by using a flex row or stacking them neatly. For \"Mudar UF\", I\'m moving away from a sprawling button block to a responsive dropdown or a clean grid layout for mobile. I\'m also increasing touch targets to at least 44px. For Plan Cards on mobile, padding is adjusted to prevent clipping, and title truncation issues are fixed. I am also implementing appropriate stacking for buttons. I\'ve also been improving the bottom card actions for better touch targets.\n\n\n**Improving Mobile UX**\n\nI\'m focusing on the tier filter tabs. I am implementing horizontal scrolling to prevent awkward line breaks on smaller screens. I also plan on making the sort dropdown full-width. I\'m prioritizing mobile side-by-side modal enhancements. The sticky first column with a white background and a bit of blur makes the tables more user-friendly. Adding a clean segmented view toggle or responsive cards is also in the works. I am adding touch-action panning for horizontal scrolling.\n\n\n**Enhancing Mobile Tables**\n\nI\'m focused on improving the display of detailed plans and export summaries on mobile. For beneficiary breakdowns in plan details, I\'ve implemented horizontal scrolling for the table and a clean list view fallback. Also, I\'m ensuring share buttons and input fields meet minimum touch target sizes. Finally, I\'m adjusting modal heights to prevent clipping on smaller screens.\n\n\n**Optimizing Mobile Components**\n\nI\'m focused on improving mobile components. I\'m aiming for a native feel in drawers and modals using `h-full sm:h-[650px] max-h-[95vh] rounded-t-2xl sm:rounded-2xl` or a clean bottom-sheet style. I\'m making the chat input with `min-h-[44px]` and quick questions scrollable horizontally. I am stacking the HospitalNetworkExplorer search input and tier filter for better mobile display.\n\n\n**Improving Mobile Comparision**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the side-by-side comparison modal for mobile devices. I\'ve been inspecting `SideBySideModal.tsx` and focusing on the implementation of a sticky first column with a white background and subtle shadow for improved readability. I\'m exploring horizontal scrolling and touch target sizes. I will make the row labels always visible and implement mobile-optimized comparison tables with horizontal scrolling, to prevent overflow issues on small screens. I am also planning on enhancing the drawer menu with links that have high tap-target sizes.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile Comparisons**\n\nI\'m focused on improving side-by-side comparison. I\'m adding a toggle for \"Complete Table\" and \"Comparison Cards\" for small screens and planning horizontal swipes. I\'m also addressing the sticky comparison bar\'s positioning in `src/App.tsx` relative to the bottom navigation. Now, I\'m working on `src/components/Header.tsx`, ensuring the brand mark never overflows, buttons are touch-friendly (44px+ hit areas), and implementing a smooth backdrop with clean tap targets for the mobile menu.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2215048"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Optimize Header for mobile viewports with proper touch targets and layout stability\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"export const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({ onStartQuote, onOpenAdvisor, activeSection }) => {\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleNavClick = (sectionId: string) => {\\n    setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n    const el = document.getElementById(sectionId);\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200 transition-colors\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-14 sm:h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n        {/* Zone 1: Single text wordmark */}\\n        <a\\n          href=\\\"#\\\"\\n          className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-display flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 shrink-0 truncate max-w-[170px] sm:max-w-none\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span className=\\\"w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 shadow-xs\\\">\\n            <Activity className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-white\\\" />\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">ComparaSa\303\272de <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline text-teal-700\\\">Brasil</span></span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: 4-6 clean text navigation links (desktop) */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 lg:gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\\\">\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#simulador\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'simulador\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Simulador\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#comparador\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'comparador\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Tabela Comparativa\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#hospitais\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'hospitais\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Hospitais\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#regras-ans\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'regras-ans\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Regras ANS\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#faq\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'faq\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            D\303\272vidas\\n          </a>\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Actions + Mobile Menu button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenAdvisor}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1.5 sm:py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-800 bg-teal-50 hover:bg-teal-100 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap border border-teal-200 min-h-[38px]\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-teal-600\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden xs:inline sm:inline\\\">Consultor IA</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"xs:hidden\\\">IA</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onStartQuote}\\n            className=\\\"px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-xs min-h-[38px] flex items-center justify-center\\\"\\n          >\\n            Cotar Agora\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile menu toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(!mobileMenuOpen)}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 md:hidden rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] flex items-center justify-center\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Abrir menu\\\"\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Drawer Navigation */}\\n      {mobileMenuOpen && (\\n        <div className=\\\"md:hidden bg-white border-b border-slate-200 p-4 space-y-3 shadow-lg animate-in slide-in-from-top-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col space-y-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(\'simulador\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors min-h-[44px] flex items-center\\\"\\n            >\\n              Simulador de Cota\303\247\303\243o\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(\'comparador\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors min-h-[44px] flex items-center\\\"\\n            >\\n              Tabela Comparativa de Planos\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(\'hospitais\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors min-h-[44px] flex items-center\\\"\\n            >\\n              Rede Hospitalar em Destaque\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(\'regras-ans\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors min-h-[44px] flex items-center\\\"\\n            >\\n              Regras e Car\303\252ncias da ANS\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(\'faq\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors min-h-[44px] flex items-center\\\"\\n            >\\n              D\303\272vidas Frequentes\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n                onOpenAdvisor();\\n              }}\\n              className=\\\"w-full py-3 px-3 bg-teal-50 text-teal-800 font-semibold rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-teal-200 min-h-[44px]\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\\\" />\\n              <span>Abrir Consultor de Intelig\303\252ncia ANS</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\", \"TargetContent\":\"export const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({ onStartQuote, onOpenAdvisor, activeSection }) => {\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleNavClick = (sectionId: string) => {\\n    setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n    const el = document.getElementById(sectionId);\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200 transition-colors\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-14 sm:h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n        {/* Zone 1: Single text wordmark */}\\n        <a\\n          href=\\\"#\\\"\\n          className=\\\"text-base sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-display flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0 truncate max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-none\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span className=\\\"w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0\\\">\\n            <Activity className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-white\\\" />\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">ComparaSa\303\272de <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Brasil</span></span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: 4-6 clean text navigation links (desktop) */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 lg:gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\\\">\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#simulador\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'simulador\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Simulador\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#comparador\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'comparador\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Tabela Comparativa\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#hospitais\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'hospitais\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Hospitais\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#regras-ans\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'regras-ans\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Regras ANS\\n          </a>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#faq\\\"\\n            className={`hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors ${\\n              activeSection === \'faq\' ? \'text-teal-600 font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            D\303\272vidas\\n          </a>\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Actions + Mobile Menu button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenAdvisor}\\n            className=\\\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-800 bg-teal-50 hover:bg-teal-100 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap border border-teal-200\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-teal-600\\\" />\\n            <span>Consultor IA</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onStartQuote}\\n            className=\\\"px-3 sm:px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm min-h-[36px] flex items-center justify-center\\\"\\n          >\\n            Cotar Agora\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile menu toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(!mobileMenuOpen)}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 md:hidden rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Abrir menu\\\"\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Drawer Navigation */}\\n      {mobileMenuOpen && (\\n        <div className=\\\"md:hidden bg-white border-b border-slate-200 p-4 space-y-3 shadow-lg animate-in slide-in-from-top-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col space-y-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(\'simulador\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n       