  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Mobile View**\n\nI\'m currently focusing on the mobile view within `src/components/LocationDetectorBar.tsx`. I\'ve examined lines 115-210, noticing the mobile padding implementation using `p-3.5 sm:p-5`. I\'m also observing the structure of the heading and badge elements, specifically the `MapPin`, location data (city, state), and method badge wrappers.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile Button Layout**\n\nI\'m now diving into the button layout within `LocationDetectorBar.tsx`. I\'m focusing on the responsive design for mobile, particularly lines that address `flex flex-col` and `sm:flex-row`. I\'ve outlined the `CEP` input, search button, and \"Mudar UF\" button, ensuring they adapt well on mobile, and examined the state picker tray when expanded. The goal is to optimize the mobile experience.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1535864"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Optimize LocationDetectorBar for mobile viewports\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-3.5 sm:p-5 border border-teal-800/60 shadow-md\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-3.5 sm:gap-5\\\">\\n        {/* Left: Current Active Location */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-300\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400 animate-pulse shrink-0\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">Localiza\303\247\303\243o Ativa para Precis\303\243o de Rede & Pre\303\247os</span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 flex-wrap\\\">\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2\\\">\\n              <MapPin className=\\\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 text-teal-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>\\n                {currentInput.city}, {currentInput.state}\\n              </span>\\n            </h3>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300\\\">\\n              ({currentStateObj ? currentStateObj.name : \'Brasil\'})\\n            </span>\\n\\n            {/* Detection method badge */}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-950/80 text-teal-300 border border-teal-700/60\\\">\\n              {currentInput.detectedLocation?.method === \'gps\'\\n                ? \'GPS\'\\n                : currentInput.detectedLocation?.method === \'cep\'\\n                ? `CEP ${currentInput.detectedLocation.cep}`\\n                : currentInput.detectedLocation?.method === \'ip\'\\n                ? \'IP\'\\n                : \'Manual\'}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-xl\\\">\\n            Tabelas e rede credenciada ajustadas para{\' \'}\\n            <strong className=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">{currentInput.city}</strong> e regi\303\243o.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right: GPS, CEP and Manual Actions - Full Width Grid on Mobile */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-2 w-full lg:w-auto\\\">\\n          {/* 1-Click GPS button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={handleDetectGps}\\n            disabled={isDetectingGps}\\n            className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-500 disabled:opacity-60 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xs whitespace-nowrap min-h-[44px] active:scale-[0.99]\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Usar localiza\303\247\303\243o do dispositivo (GPS)\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isDetectingGps ? (\\n              <>\\n                <Loader2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-spin\\\" />\\n                <span>Localizando via GPS...</span>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <>\\n                <Crosshair className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-200\\\" />\\n                <span>Identificar Meu Local (GPS)</span>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* CEP Input Form & Button */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n            <form onSubmit={handleLookupCep} className=\\\"flex-1 sm:flex-initial flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={cepInput}\\n                onChange={(e) => handleCepInputChange(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Digitar CEP\\\"\\n                maxLength={9}\\n                className=\\\"w-full sm:w-40 px-3 py-2.5 bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-teal-500 font-mono min-h-[44px]\\\"\\n              />\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n                disabled={isSearchingCep}\\n                className=\\\"p-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:text-white rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition-colors min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 active:scale-[0.97]\\\"\\n                title=\\\"Buscar CEP\\\"\\n              >\\n                {isSearchingCep ? (\\n                  <Loader2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-spin text-teal-400\\\" />\\n                ) : (\\n                  <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                )}\\n              </button>\\n            </form>\\n\\n            {/* Toggle manual selector */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setIsManualExpanded(!isManualExpanded)}\\n              className=\\\"px-3 py-2.5 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap min-h-[44px] shrink-0\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isManualExpanded ? \'Ocultar\' : \'Mudar UF\'}\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Feedback Alert if any */}\\n      {feedback && (\\n        <div\\n          className={`mt-3 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs flex items-center gap-2 ${\\n            feedback.type === \'success\'\\n              ? \'bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-200 border border-emerald-800\'\\n              : \'bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-200 border border-rose-800\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          {feedback.type === \'success\' ? (\\n            <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n          ) : (\\n            <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n          )}\\n          <span className=\\\"leading-snug\\\">{feedback.message}</span>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Quick State Picker Tray when expanded */}\\n      {isManualExpanded && (\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 space-y-2\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 block font-medium\\\">\\n            Selecione o seu Estado para calibrar a cota\303\247\303\243o regional:\\n          </span>\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 sm:flex sm:flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-xs max-h-52 overflow-y-auto p-1\\\">\\n            {BRAZILIAN_STATES.map((st) => (\\n              <button\\n                key={st.uf}\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  onLocationChange({\\n                    city: st.name,\\n                    state: st.uf,\\n                    stateName: st.name,\\n                    method: \'manual\',\\n                    accuracy: \'approximate\',\\n                  });\\n                  setIsManualExpanded(false);\\n                }}\\n                className={`px-2 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors border text-xs min-h-[40px] flex items-center justify-center font-medium ${\\n                  currentInput.state === st.uf\\n                    ? \'bg-teal-600 text-white border-teal-500 font-semibold\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-700\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {st.uf}\\n              </button>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\", \"TargetContent\":\"  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-teal-800/60 shadow-md\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-5\\\">\\n        {/* Left: Current Active Location */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-300\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400 animate-pulse shrink-0\\\" />\\n            <span>Localiza\303\247\303\243o Ativa para Precis\303\243o de Rede & Pre\303\247os</span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-2 flex-wrap\\\">\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2\\\">\\n              <MapPin className=\\\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 text-teal-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>\\n                {currentInput.city}, {currentInput.state}\\n              </span>\\n            </h3>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300\\\">\\n              ({currentStateObj ? currentStateObj.name : \'Brasil\'})\\n            </span>\\n\\n            {/* Detection method badge */}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-950/80 text-teal-300 border border-teal-700/60\\\">\\n              {currentInput.detectedLocation?.method === \'gps\'\\n                ? \'Sinal de GPS\'\\n                : currentInput.detectedLocation?.method === \'cep\'\\n                ? `CEP ${currentInput.detectedLocation.cep}`\\n                : currentInput.detectedLocation?.method === \'ip\'\\n                ? \'Detec\303\247\303\243o por IP\'\\n                : \'Sele\303\247\303\243o Regional\'}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-xl\\\">\\n            Tabelas e hospitais credenciados ajustados para{\' \'}\\n            <strong className=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">{currentInput.city}</strong> e regi\303\243o.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right: GPS, CEP and Manual Actions - Full Width Grid on Mobile */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-2 w-full lg:w-auto\\\">\\n          {/* 1-Click GPS button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={handleDetectGps}\\n            disabled={isDetectingGps}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-500 disabled:opacity-60 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap min-h-[44px]\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Usar localiza\303\247\303\243o do dispositivo (GPS)\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isDetectingGps ? (\\n              <>\\n                <Loader2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-spin\\\" />\\n                <span>Localizando via GPS...</span>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <>\\n                <Crosshair className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-200\\\" />\\n                <span>Identificar Meu Local (GPS)</span>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* CEP Input Form & Button */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n            <form onSubmit={handleLookupCep} className=\\\"flex-1 sm:flex-initial flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={cepInput}\\n                onChange={(e) => handleCepInputChange(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Digitar CEP (ex: 01310-100)\\\"\\n                maxLength={9}\\n                className=\\\"w-full sm:w-44 px-3 py-2.5 bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-teal-500 font-mono min-h-[44px]\\\"\\n              />\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n                disabled={isSearchingCep}\\n                className=\\\"p-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:text-white rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition-colors min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\"\\n         