  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Enhancing Navigation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on improving the user flow within `QuoteWizard.tsx`. I plan to integrate ArrowRight and ArrowLeft for step navigation. I\'m also adding horizontal scroll to preset buttons and adjusting the height of tabs. Finally, I intend to implement a clear step navigation system at the bottom of each tab to streamline the user journey.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
