  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining App Icons**\n\nI\'m currently focused on identifying the necessary icons for the mobile bottom tab bar in `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve decided on icons: `Calculator`, `Sliders`, or `FileSpreadsheet` for \"Simulador\"; `Layers` for \"Planos\"; and `Building2` for \"Hospitais.\" This should provide a clear visual representation of each section.\n\n\n**Confirming Icon Choices**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the icon choices for the bottom tab bar. I will use `SlidersHorizontal` for \"Simular,\" `Layers` for \"Comparar,\" `Building2` for \"Hospitais,\" and `Sparkles` for \"Consultor IA.\" I\'ve updated the `src/App.tsx` file with this configuration. I\'m now implementing the mobile bottom navigation bar, which will be fixed to the bottom of the screen. I\'m aiming for a clear and intuitive design.\n\n\n**Refining Bottom Navigation**\n\nI\'m now integrating the navigation buttons into the layout using Tailwind CSS classes. I\'ve focused on ensuring each button is centered, uses appropriate spacing, and reacts visually on hover and press, maintaining accessibility and a clean look. I\'m leveraging `flex` and `justify-center` to arrange the icons and labels neatly, ensuring they are responsive.\n\n\n"
